@startuml
title The classifier goes away — and this is the classifier: preamble + fragments, one call (temperature 0)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

database "ToolRegistry\n(the live record for this env:\ninstance{build,commit,env,live})" as REG #eef6f5

package "Per tool, declared in source" #fdfdfd {
  [ProviderSearch\nUTTERANCE_MANAGER_PROMPT] as F1
  [SpecialtyFilter\nUTTERANCE_MANAGER_PROMPT] as F2
  [LockoutTool\nNOT_UTTERANCE_ROUTABLE] as F3
}

[UtteranceManager\nown entry = the preamble\n(cached system prompt)\nclassify + prose only] as UM
[One model call\ntemperature 0] as CALL
[UniversalNavigator\nvalidates routes against may_call,\nthen dispatches] as UN
[Dispatch\n(parallel, non-blocking)] as DISP

database "Users.UserLockOutUtterances\n(UPPERCASED utterance + count)" as LOCK #eef6f5

F1 -down-> REG : fragment
F2 -down-> REG : fragment
F3 -[#9ca3af]down-> REG : declares itself\nunreachable

REG -down-> UM : the assembled fragments
UM -down-> CALL : preamble + every fragment + the utterance
CALL -down-> UN : routes out — the dispatch set
UN -down-> DISP

' Safety lockout is layered — deterministic on the known, temperature-0 model on the unknown
LOCK -[#b45309]right-> CALL : exact UPPERCASED repeat =\ndeterministic lockout (no model)
CALL -[#b45309]down-> LOCK : an enforced lockout records\nthe UPPERCASED utterance (+count)

note right of UM
  The UtteranceManager knows NO parameters.
  It sees an utterance and answers with routes.
  ---
  OPEN ARCHITECTURAL QUESTION (unresolved):
  is asking the user a question the UtteranceManager's
  own scope (classify + prose here), or a separate
  "Prose" tool? Three approved requirements place prose
  inside it (EPIC-002-F-010-S-001 / -S-003, EPIC-006-F-008-S-003);
  the operator's to decide. Do not pick a side.
end note

note right of F3
  A tool declares exactly one of the two.
  Silence refuses the build, so a safety
  tool's unreachability is a decision.
  ---
  Safety lockout is layered, not one
  non-deterministic call. The model decides
  the UNKNOWN (temperature 0). A curated,
  crowd-sourced exact-match list decides the
  KNOWN: ChatHealthy staff review a monthly
  frequency-ordered report and promote learned
  utterances to trusted deterministic triggers.
end note

note bottom of UN
  First pass mines broadly; refinement is
  narrower and more rigorous. The scoping —
  which fragments, page-first or broad, how
  rigor climbs per pass — lives in the
  navigator's dispatch code, not in the model.
end note
@enduml
